{"role":"assistant","content":"The logs show three distinct breakpoints: browser navigation drops the bearer token, the provider rejects the generated authorize request, and the successful token response had no refresh token. I’m checking the provider’s exact OAuth parameters before changing the request and token lifecycle.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_geLmQp8jeoUTi04skUQ1hGh0","function":{"name":"WebSearch","arguments":"{\"query\":\"site:forum.intervals.icu OAuth refresh_token offline_access scopes response_type\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"tool_HdkXn3Mhx8lVwiFUx1UBukAU","function":{"name":"WebSearch","arguments":"{\"query\":\"Intervals.icu API OAuth2 scopes CALENDAR:WRITE refresh token expires_in\"}"}}]}
