{"role":"assistant","content":"Fixed the Intervals.icu integration and documented the causes in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n- **Connect 401:** The button now obtains the authorize URL through the authenticated API wrapper before navigating (`static/app.js`, `server.py`).\n- **Provider `invalid_request`:** Removed redundant `READ` scopes where `WRITE` already includes read access (`config.py`).\n- **Hourly reconnects:** Tokens without `expires_in` are no longer assigned an invented 3,600-second lifetime or expired by the refresher (`server.py`).\n\nVerified with Python and JavaScript syntax checks plus a local end-to-end OAuth stand-in covering the SPA Connect click, callback, connected status, wellness access, and background refresh passes. No deployment or external API writes were performed."}
